<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A17" title="In Mitigating Multimodal Hallucinations via Gradient-based Self-Reflection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">Q </span>Qualitative Example on Occluded Images</span></a></li>
