<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>First Order Taylor Expansion</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The first order Taylor expansion of <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math> w.r.t., <math id="A1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p}</annotation></semantics></math> and, all the previous output tokens <math id="A1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{y}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{y}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i&lt;m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i&lt;m</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A1.E14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E14X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}\approx" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}\approx</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v(0)},\mathbf{t}^{p(0)})_{m}+\sum^{S}_{s=1}\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{v}_{s}}\bigg|_{\mathbf{t}^{v(0)}}({t}^{v}_{s}-{t}^{v(0)}_{s})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v(0)},\mathbf{t}^{p(0)})_{m}+\sum^{S}_{s=1}\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{v}_{s}}\bigg|_{\mathbf{t}^{v(0)}}({t}^{v}_{s}-{t}^{v(0)}_{s})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E14Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\sum^{N}_{n=1}\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{p}_{n}}\bigg|_{\mathbf{t}^{p(0)}}({t}^{p}_{n}-{t}^{p(0)}_{n})+\sum^{m-1}_{i=1}\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial y_{i}}\bigg|_{y^{(0)}_{i}}(y_{i}-y^{(0)}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence="false" maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>p</mi></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence="false" maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="true">|</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\sum^{N}_{n=1}\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{p}_{n}}\bigg|_{\mathbf{t}^{p(0)}}({t}^{p}_{n}-{t}^{p(0)}_{n})+\sum^{m-1}_{i=1}\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial y_{i}}\bigg|_{y^{(0)}_{i}}(y_{i}-y^{(0)}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E14Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14Xb.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum^{S}_{s=1}\mathbf{g}^{v}_{ms}{t}^{v}_{s}+\sum^{N}_{n=1}\mathbf{g}^{p}_{mn}{t}^{p}_{n}+\sum^{m-1}_{i=1}\mathbf{g}^{y}_{mi}y_{i}+Const," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mi>v</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum^{S}_{s=1}\mathbf{g}^{v}_{ms}{t}^{v}_{s}+\sum^{N}_{n=1}\mathbf{g}^{p}_{mn}{t}^{p}_{n}+\sum^{m-1}_{i=1}\mathbf{g}^{y}_{mi}y_{i}+Const,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{g}^{v}_{ms}=\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{v}_{s}}\Big|_{\mathbf{t}^{v}=\mathbf{t}^{v(0)}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mi>v</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}^{v}_{ms}=\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{v}_{s}}\Big|_{\mathbf{t}^{v}=\mathbf{t}^{v(0)}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{g}^{p}_{mn}=\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{p}_{n}}\Big|_{\mathbf{t}^{p}=\mathbf{t}^{p(0)}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>p</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}^{p}_{mn}=\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial{t}^{p}_{n}}\Big|_{\mathbf{t}^{p}=\mathbf{t}^{p(0)}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{g}^{y}_{mi}=\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial y_{i}}\Big|_{\mathbf{y}_{i}=\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v(0)},\mathbf{t}^{p(0)})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐠</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐲</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}^{y}_{mi}=\frac{\partial(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}})_{m}}{\partial y_{i}}\Big|_{\mathbf{y}_{i}=\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v(0)},\mathbf{t}^{p(0)})}</annotation></semantics></math>
are the first order gradients w.r.t., visual tokens <math id="A1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}^{v}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}^{v}</annotation></semantics></math>, text prompt <math id="A1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}^{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}^{p}</annotation></semantics></math> and previous outputs <math id="A1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Const" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Const</annotation></semantics></math> denotes all other terms that are constant w.r.t., the <math id="A1.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Interpreting Contrastive Decoding through KL Divergence</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Kullback-Leibler (KL) divergence can be used to interpret contrastive decoding, For example, in GACD VA mode, it measures the divergence between the reference distribution <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})</annotation></semantics></math> to the visual joint distribution <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
<table id="A2.E15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A2.E15X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{D}_{KL}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{D}_{KL}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})\text{log}\big(\frac{p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})}{p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>log</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})\text{log}\big(\frac{p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})}{p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})}\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="5" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E15Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})(\text{log}(p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m}))-\text{log}(p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>log</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext>log</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})(\text{log}(p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m}))-\text{log}(p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E15Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}[c]-\text{log}(\sum\exp(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext>log</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mstyle><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}[c]-\text{log}(\sum\exp(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E15Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}[c]+\text{log}(\sum\exp(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext>log</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mrow><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mstyle><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}[c]+\text{log}(\sum\exp(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E15Xd" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E15Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})(\underbrace{(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}-\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})}_{\text{adjustment term}}[c]+Const)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>adjustment term</mtext></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{c}p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})(\underbrace{(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}-\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})}_{\text{adjustment term}}[c]+Const),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})=\mathbf{\sigma}(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})=\mathbf{\sigma}(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})=\mathbf{\sigma}(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup></msub><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(y_{cm}|\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{\star}},\mathbf{t}^{p},y_{&lt;m})=\mathbf{\sigma}(\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math> represents a class in the predefined vocabulary. The adjustment term <math id="A2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}-\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>v</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐭</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{v},\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}-\mathcal{F}_{\theta^{*}}(\mathbf{t}^{p})_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> increases the KL divergence, thereby emphasizing the impact of visual tokens.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Result on modern MLLMs</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We further evaluate modern MLLMs, LLaVA-v1.6 and Intern-VL2, on the Amber dataset. The results in Tab. <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix C Result on modern MLLMs ‣ Mitigating Multimodal Hallucinations via Gradient-based Self-Reflection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> demonstrate that our method consistently improves MLLM performance, even when their original performance is high.</p>
</div>
